flowchart LR
    P1[Pass 1: Survey<br/>15-20% time] --> P1a[Skim headings, diagrams, summary]
    P1a --> P1b[Write 3-5 pre-reading questions]
    P1b --> P1c[Build one-page topic mind map]

    P2[Pass 2: Detailed Study<br/>50-60% time] --> P2a[Read section by section]
    P2a --> P2b[Close book & recall key point per section]
    P2b --> P2c[Solve 2-3 simple problems per concept]

    P3[Pass 3: Integration<br/>20-30% time] --> P3a[Recreate mind map from memory]
    P3a --> P3b[Solve mixed PYQs]
    P3b --> P3c[Teach the chapter aloud]

    P1c --> P2
    P2c --> P3
